  "Scenes.Emberscene.DontEggFap.ItemsNoReaction": "[pg]You start fishing through your pockets, holding up the various items you have; it doesn't react to some, while others make its flashes quicken. These you set aside. When you've finished testing the contents of your pouches, you look at the items the egg has selected. As you rest your hand on the egg and consider your choices, it begins to excite once more, alarming you. You pull away and it calms down... the egg considers <b>you</b> an item as well, apparently!"
