  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBitchesAboutPCBeingFullOfEggs.StaringAtEggBelly": "As you try and think of a topic to talk about, you realize Ember is staring at your egg-swollen stomach - not with anger or disdain, but with interest. With a smirk, you place one hand on your belly and ask if [Ember ey] finds you interesting to look at like this."
