  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreastfeeding.EmberNotWaiting": "Ember isn't waiting for you when you [if (singleleg) {{enter|step into}}] [ember eir] den, [if (emberkids > 1) {{but one of your dragon children leads you to|and you set about searching for her, heading to}}] the back of the cave. There you find {0} sitting in [ember eir] nest {1} [if (littleember) {{struggling to hold|holding}}] your newborn against [if (littleember) {{[ember eir] barely budding, yet still milk-laden chest|{2}}}]. Your little dragon[if (emberroundface){{-{3}}}] suckles contently, and the smile on [kid.his] {4}'s face as [ember ey] glances up at your approach makes it hard not to share in [ember eir] joy."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreastfeeding.GreetingWhatToday": "[pg][say: [if (littleember) {What are we going to do today?|What brings you here today?}]]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreastfeeding.KeepsGettingBigger": "[pg][if (littleember) {[say: [Kid.he] keeps getting bigger...] As if to show you, Ember hefts your growing newborn higher in [ember eir] arms. [say: Soon [kid.he]'ll be bigger than me.]|[say: At this rate, [kid.he]'ll be a full-size [dragonkid] in no time.]}] Your newborn's rapid development seems to cause Ember concern, but [ember ey] calms down a little when you explain that's just how things work here."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreastfeeding.LeaningIntoWarmth": "[pg]The three of you remain there, leaning into each other's warmth as the comfortable silence washes over you. Soon Ember pads away, tucking your child into [kid.his] grassy bed{0}, before returning back to your side. [Ember ey] steals a kiss as [ember ey] leads you back to the center of [ember eir] den."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreastfeeding.OfferToTakeKid": "[pg]You tell [ember eir] that [if (islactating) {[ember ey] could give [kid.him] to you if [ember ey] needs a break, but Ember shakes [ember eir] head. [say: Of course I can do this,] [ember ey] replies, though you suspect it's more to [ember emself] than to you.|[ember ey]'s doing great, and Ember swells with pride at your praise. [say: Thanks to you.]}]"
