  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreedingAfterMathWatchOutForRadioactiveFallout.SpotEmberGuarding": "[pg]Looking around for the dragon, you spot [Ember em] seated in a cross-legged position halfway in and out of the [cabin]'s door. Was [Ember ey] guarding you while you slept?"
