  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreedingAfterMathWatchOutForRadioactiveFallout.WakeFeelingReplenished": "You wake up, feeling replenished after your exhausting mating session with {0}, and stretch the last few kinks out. As you do, you realize you're in still in your [cabin], which is perfectly clean, with no trace of the copious sexual fluids that you and Ember were splattering everywhere before you took your impromptu nap."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreedingAfterMathWatchOutForRadioactiveFallout.WonderIfPointOut": "[pg]You wonder if you should point out that it's only fair Ember cleaned it, seeing as how [Ember ey] made the bulk of the mess, but decide to simply thank [Ember em] for [Ember eir] generosity. Absently, your hand goes to "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberBreedingAfterMathWatchOutForRadioactiveFallout.YellsIndignantlyRushesAway": " once more. [say: D-don't get ahead of yourself!] [Ember ey] yells indignantly, then gets up and rushes away. You watch and give a smile; [Ember ey] is champing at the bit to make children with you, but can't bring [Ember emself] to confess how [Ember ey] really feels. Still, you're quite certain your efforts took."
