  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberCampDesc.DrakeHeartPlaced": " The Drake's Heart flower you gifted [Ember eir] is delicately placed on a small pile of earth, next to where [Ember ey] sleeps. "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberCampDesc.EggInNest": "[pg]The mysterious egg you found in the cave sits in the grass nest you assembled for it; it is three feet tall and nearly two feet in circumference. The nest itself isn't very pretty, but at least it's sturdy enough to keep the egg from rolling around."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberCampDesc.EmberIsTuckedSnugly": "{0}"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberCampDesc.FightingSleep": "Ember appears to be fighting to stay awake; sometimes [Ember ey] falls into a doze, but quickly snaps back to consciousness."
