  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberCampDesc.LiesInFrontDen": "Ember is lying in front of [Ember eir] excavated den, watching the camp and resting. Every once in a while [Ember eir] eyes dart in your direction, before [Ember ey] quickly looks away."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberCampDesc.NotAroundDen": "Ember doesn't seem to be around [Ember eir] excavated den... it doesn't take long before Ember lands in front of it and then takes off again, apparently occupied with darting around in the sky for fun."
