  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberCampMenu.SighsWhatWant": "Ember sighs as you approach, and doesn't even look you in the eye before speaking. [say: What do you want?]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberEggAppearance.EmberWatchesCurious": "Ember merely watches with curiosity as you make your way over to the crude nest in the corner of [ember eir] den, but it doesn't take long before [ember ey] steps beside you{0}. {1} of you watch over the egg in silence, its presence undeniable proof of your coming child with Ember[if (littleember) {{[if (ischild) {{, even though you're both still kids yourselves|, even though [ember ey]'s still a child [ember emself]}}]|[if (ischild){{, even though you're only a child yourself}}]}}]. [if (tallness < 48) {{It's nearly as large as you|It's larger than you would have thought}}], but you suppose that[if (littleember) {{ Ember still has much to grow [ember emself]|'s to be expected from someone of Ember's size}}]."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberEggAppearance.PeacefulNestledEgg": "[pg]It looks so peaceful nestled in its grassy bed that you can't help but feel content yourself, especially when you lay your hand on the egg and feel its warmth seep into you. Unlike the egg Ember hatched from, this one doesn't react to your touch--it seems that your child will have to develop the old-fashioned way."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberEggAppearance.PullsYouClose": "[pg][say: Just a little while longer, [name].] [if (littleember) {{Ember takes your hand and leans into you|Ember wraps [ember eir] arm around you, pulling you close}}]. {0}"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberEggInteraction.ApproachEggPulsing": "You approach the egg you found in that illusion-concealed cave. Though the light continues to pulse with its heartbeat overtones, it still just sits there, doing nothing."
