  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberGetOverFreakingOutAboutMinoJizz.AppreciateIntent": "[pg]You tell her that you do appreciate [Ember eir] intent, and you're sorry [Ember ey] had to put [Ember eir] stomach through so much abuse on your behalf."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberGetOverFreakingOutAboutMinoJizz.BellyrubPet": "[pg][say: B-bellyrub? What do I look like!? A pet!?] Ember yells, rubbing [Ember eir] belly [Ember em]self."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberGetOverFreakingOutAboutMinoJizz.ChronicIndigestion": "[pg]Noting the chronic indigestion [Ember ey] has been plagued with since starting this little crusade, you'd have thought the last thing [Ember ey]'d want for a while is more food. After all, the reason [Ember ey]'s got such a bad case of wind is because [Ember ey] keeps eating too much."
