  "Scenes.Emberscene.EmberGetOverFreakingOutAboutMinoJizz.NoHuntMinotaurs": "[pg]You point out that this means [Ember ey] no longer has to hunt down minotaurs, for your sake. Which furthermore means, you note, that she can stop leaving cow skulls and hooves and other rubbish all over the camp."
