  "Scenes.Emberscene.SuckEmberCock.WaryOfBattyWays": "increasingly leery of [Ember eir] batty behavior"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.SuckEmberCock.WeakGrinBobbing": "[pg]You weakly grin around [Ember eir] jaw-stretcher of a cock and start to bob your head back and forth as much as you can. You can feel [Ember eir] tip jabbing into what feels like your belly and you try to clench your throat around the inhumanly-long tool, sucking madly on the part still inside your actual mouth."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.SuckEmberCock.WorriesAboutChoking": "[pg][say: D-don't force yourself. Don't want you choking on my dick,] Ember pants, starting to lose [Ember eir] cool as the pleasure escalates."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.BackCorridorBlocked": "[pg]You make it back to the strange corridor entrance... but when you attempt to cross over into the cave's opening, you feel the egg bump into something. Alarmed, you quickly scan its surface."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.CarryEasy": " Between the egg's surprising lightness, and your own size and wide arms, you can easily carry the egg."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.DecidesTakeEgg": "You decide to take the egg, figuring that perhaps this dragon could aid you in your quest."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.ElectricityRunSpine": "[pg]You feel electricity run down your spine as you pass by a far wall in the back of the cave; inspecting the wall, you quickly locate an odd rock. When you pick it up, you realize it has some sort of inscription drawn all over the underside; figuring it's probably the source of the ward, you fling the rock at the far wall, shattering it into many pieces."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.IntactRollPast": "[pg]Thankfully, it seems to be intact; you put the egg down and try to roll it gently past the open cave mouth. It bumps something again, something invisible. Then you recall the book's mention of some sort of ward protecting the egg; when you try to touch and feel the invisible ward however, your hand goes right through. In fact you can cross this 'ward' easily, as if it weren't even there... However, if you attempt to carry the egg, there is a solid barrier preventing it from passing through."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.LeaveEggForNow": "[pg]It looks like you will have to leave the egg for now until you're better versed in magical methods... or strong enough to knock down a mountain! You roll it back down the corridor into its shrine to prevent its being seen from the cave entrance."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.LongerThanAnticipated": "[pg]It takes a lot longer than you originally anticipated, but sure enough, soon you feel a small pulse of energy run through the chamber and into the corridor. Running towards the entrance; you discover that you can easily remove the egg. It begins to glow softly as you remove it from the cave; at first you take it for a trick of the light, but remember there isn't any in this damned dark swamp!"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.LooksForWayOut": "[pg]Vexed, you decide to look around the egg chamber for another way out."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.LooksOverAgain": "[pg]You look around over and over and over... but no matter how much you look you don't see anything at all that could even resemble some kind of magic rune, or activation button, or anything that could disable the ward. You groan in frustration."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.LooksOverAndOver": "[pg]You look around over and over and over... but no matter how much you look, you don't see anything at all that could even resemble some kind of magic rune, or activation button, or anything that could disable the ward. You groan in frustration."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.MakeWayStrength": "[pg]Well, if there is no way out all you have to do is make one, right? Using your immense strength, you break off a sturdy-looking stalagmite and begin striking the walls in hopes of breaking through or disabling the barrier."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.PulseIntoCorridor": "[pg]You feel a small pulse of energy run through the chamber and into the corridor. Running towards the entrance; you discover that you can easily remove the egg. It begins to glow softly as you remove it from the cave; at first you take it for a trick of the light, but remember there isn't any in this damned dark swamp!"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.QuestBegun": "[pg](<b>You have now begun the Mysterious Egg quest. The Mysterious Egg is added to the <i>Camp Actions</i> at the Camp.</b>)"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TakeEmbersEggHomeInADoggieBag.SurprisinglyLight": " Lifting it isn't as much of a problem as you thought; it's surprisingly light. It is, however, very big and very awkward to carry."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmber.TalkTopicPrompt": "What will you talk about?"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.AskAboutSpecies": "You ask Ember to tell you more about [Ember eir] species."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.AskIfAllRight": "[pg]You ask if [Ember ey]'s all right. [say: Huh? Yes, I'm fine! Anyways, lesson's over.] Ember hurriedly goes back inside [Ember eir] den."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.AskSpeakUp": "[pg]You ask [Ember em] to speak up. Ember blurts out, [say: Nothing! Lesson's over...] before withdrawing into [Ember eir] den."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.BlushCreeping": ", a blush creeping onto [Ember eir] cheeks"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.CrossesArmsPride": "[pg]Ember crosses {0}{1} arms. [say: Dragons are powerful and proud! You would never see a dragon back away from a challenge; instead, we relish in competition.] Ember continues talking about how dragons like to challenge each other. Although interesting at first, you get bored soon, so you excuse yourself and leave. Ember seems not to notice, and looks pleased to have had the chance to extol the virtues of [Ember eir] species."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.DragonDaydreaming": "[pg]You swear you can see the dragon daydreaming at your words, but it doesn't last. [say: {0}I don't mind some curiosity, but don't try and get fresh with me!] {1} demeanor suggests annoyance, but just maybe it's a tough front, and [Ember ey]'s really waiting for you to show some affection and attention."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.DragonHabitsTalk": "[pg]Ember begins talking about dragon habits, and the cave mouth framing [Ember em] makes you wonder why dragons dig such dens. Ember shrugs. [say: It's convenient. The stone is tough and can resist all forms of hazard, plus I'll always know I can keep my stuff safe inside.] [Ember ey] stares at [Ember eir] den in deep thought."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.DrakesHeartFlower": "[pg]Ember elaborates on dragon courtship. [say: There's a rare flower, called Drake's Heart. It's very beautiful, and the perfume, especially for dragons, is exquisite. Usually, dragons give this flower to the ones they intend to court.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.EmbarrassedReaction": "[pg]The {0}dragon makes no effort to hide [Ember eir] embarrassed reaction as [Ember ey] reads a little too much into your inquiry. [say: Um... I-ho... well...] Ember stammers out. [say: {1}I have other things to do{2}]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.FaceTurnsSerious": "[pg]Ember stops talking, [Ember eir] face turns serious for a moment; [Ember ey] looks deep in thought. [say: Dragons wouldn't mate a non-dragon... in fact, dragons wouldn't even find non-dragons attractive...] You think you hear [Ember em] mumble. [say: {0}]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.FlowerMysteryAsk": "[pg]The flower an utter mystery to you, you curiously ask Ember what this [say: Drake's Heart] looks like, and where it grows... or used to grow."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.MatingRituals": "[pg]Ember decides to talk about dragon mating rituals. [say: Dragons prove themselves to each other by showing off their strength... it isn't necessarily limited to just physical strength. Usually it's done in competition. A good mate has to be proud, brave, wise and strong. So, as you can see, it's pretty certain you wouldn't find a dragon mating a non-dragon.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.SnortsAmusedSmile": "[pg]Snorting, Ember cracks an amused smile as [Ember ey] {0}. [say: What, does the 'Champion' think [him]self worthy of courting me? That's a good one!] {1} giggles openly to make [Ember eir] lack of interest in you known... yet, it seems rather forced."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.StopsAbruptly": "[pg][say: It's kinda small though... I might need a bigger one if...] Ember stops abruptly"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.ThankConversationDone": "[pg]Wondering at the dragon's thoughts, you agree to call the conversation done, and politely thank [Ember em] for [Ember eir] time."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutDragonzzz.ThinksThenAnatomy": "[pg]Ember thinks for a moment before saying. [say: Well, let's talk about dragon anatomy.] Ember begins explaining about the finer points of how a dragon works... [say: And if we're immobilized we can still use a powerful breath attack. Normally dragons can only use one element, but I can use three!] Ember says, proudly puffing out [Ember eir]{0} chest. You thank Ember for the explanation, then leave."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.AskWhatThinks": "You ask Ember what [Ember ey] thinks about you."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.CatchThrowBack": "You easily catch the pebble and throw it back at Ember, surprising [Ember em]. [say: With reflexes like these, you could even...] Ember mumbles. [say: D-Don't even think about it!] [Ember ey] snaps."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.DeflectPebblePraise": "You successfully deflect the pebble. [say: Not bad! Next time try to catch it,] Ember says, pleased."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.DoingFineKeepTraining": "you're doing fine, but make sure you don't slack off, and keep training.[sayend] You thank Ember for sharing [Ember eir] thoughts."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.EyesLingerForm": " Ember's eyes linger on your form. After a moment of awkward silence, you clear your throat. [Ember ey] blinks and says hurriedly. [say: Sorry... I was just admiring you-] Realizing what [Ember ey] was about to say, and quickly blurts out. [say: I mean the weather! Yes, nice day today isn't it?] You're not convinced, but let it slide. Ember recomposes and clears [Ember eir] throat before saying."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.EyesWidenGreatWisdom": "Ember's eyes widen. [say: I see great wisdom in your eyes...] Ember's face grows more absent by the minute as [Ember ey] looks at you in deep thought, until the trance breaks. {0} blows at your face, brushing a claw on your forehead. [say: Y-You had something in your face... I wasn't staring into your{1} eyes.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.HeresWhatIThink": "[pg][saystart]All right, here's what I think about you: "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.LiftAnythingEvenMe": " [say: With muscles like these, you could easily lift anything you wanted... even me...] Ember trails off{0}. [say: N-Not that I'd want you to carry me in your arms or anything...]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.LooksIntoEyes": "[pg]Then the dragon looks directly into your eyes. "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.LooksYouOver": "[pg]Ember puts a hand on [Ember eir] chin and looks you over carefully. {0} closes up on you and grips your arms, checking your muscles."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.MiracleYouSurvived": "this is not good at all; it's a miracle you even managed to survive in this world thus far. With the things I've seen roaming the land...[sayend] Ember trails off, concerned. [say: You should stay in the camp; I'll help you train.] You don't much like the assessment."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.NeedMoreTraining": " [say: You could use more training; you look pretty weak...] Ember says, critically."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.PebbleHitsBelly": "You try to block the pebble, but you're not quick enough. It hits your belly, not hard enough to hurt. [say: You need to work on your reactions; anything could surprise you out there and you'd be helpless.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.PokesChestRibs": "[pg]Next, Ember pokes at your chest and your ribs. "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.QuiteACatch": "you're quite a catch... If you strolled down the street you'd have dragons fawning all over you...[sayend] Realizing what [Ember ey] just said, Ember coughs furiously. [say: I-I mean... lesser dragons might fawn all over you. You don't meet my standards!]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.SatisfiedTurns": "[pg]Satisfied, Ember turns to take another look at you."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.SeeWisdomLessons": "[say: I see wisdom in your eyes, but you could always use more lessons.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.ShowOffBody": "[say: Your body's as tough as rock, you should show off more frequently... N-Not that I'd want you to go naked! You should always wear something to protect yourself,] [Ember ey] quickly adds."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.StillVeryNaive": "[say: You're still very naive... anyone or anything could trick you at any time...] Ember frowns."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.StrongAsDragon": " [say: You're well on your way to being as strong as a dragon, but there's still room for improvement.] Ember says, pleased."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.ThinkFastPebble": "[pg]Ember walks away, back turned to you. Then suddenly [Ember ey] says [say: Think fast!] and flicks [Ember eir] tail, flinging a pebble at you. "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.ToughAsMe": "[say: Not bad; some more training and you could be as tough as me!] Ember says, pleased."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.WasteOfTime": "[pg][say: You're a waste of time,] Ember says nonchalantly. {0} walks past you and then flies off."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TalkToEmberAboutYourself.WindBlowAway": "[say: I don't know how you could hope to survive out there. You look like the wind could blow you away.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TimeToPuffTheMagicDragon.AvoidClingingClaws": "[pg]Somehow you manage to avoid [Ember eir] clinging claws and strip off to your undergarments, which Ember promptly bites into, nearly ripping them off your [legs]. Ember flops down on your [bed], chewing on your undies. {0} spreads her legs invitingly and spits out your - now soaked - underpants. [say: Let's do it on your bed! It smells so much like you... Did I say how good you smell? C'mon, [name]; fuck me dammit!]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TimeToPuffTheMagicDragon.BarelyResistInsinuations": "[pg]You barely manage to resist [Ember eir] insinuations, instead forcing yourself to stagger over to your [cabin] for privacy's sake. It's harder than you'd think, not just because of the raging fire in your loins, but because {0} insistently clinging to you, doing [Ember eir] damndest to remove your [armor]. You can appreciate [Ember eir] enthusiasm, but all [Ember ey]'s doing is getting in the way!"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TimeToPuffTheMagicDragon.CantTakeItAnymore": "[pg]You can't take it anymore and throw yourself at [Ember em]; [Ember ey] wants you so bad? Well, you want [Ember em] just as bad; let's see what [Ember ey]'ll do with you!"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TimeToPuffTheMagicDragon.DazedSniffEmber": "Dazed and befuddled, you sniff Ember right back. Mmm... {0} smells delicious too, you tell [Ember em]."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TimeToPuffTheMagicDragon.EmberPurrsStealingLick": "[pg][say: I know, rrrrriggghhht?] Ember purrs in your ear, stealing a teasing lick. [say: Oh by Marae, take off your [armor] and let's do it! I don't care if we're in the middle of the camp!]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.TimeToPuffTheMagicDragon.WhoShouldBearKids": "[pg](Who should bear the kids?)"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UpdateVaginalPregnancy.ParagraphBreakPlaceholder": "[pg]{0}[pg]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseIncubusDraftOnEmber.DrizzleIncubusDraft": "Uncorking the vial, you drizzle the slimy off-white fluid onto the pointed cone of the egg. It oozes slowly across the surface, then seeps through the shell, leaving not a drop of moisture."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseIncubusDraftOnEmber.ShellLavender": " The egg's shell slowly changes to a lavender hue."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseIncubusDraftOnEmber.ShellPastelBlue": " The egg's shell slowly changes to a soft, pastel blue."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseLactaidOnEmber.PourCreamyLactaid": "Feeling a little bemused, you pour the creamy fluid onto the egg. It is absorbed through the shell, and a spiderwork of creamy yellow vein-like markings suddenly forms on the shell's surface."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseLolipopOnEmber.GrindCandyPaste": "You grind the hard candy into a powder and mix it with water, turning it into a sticky red paste. The sweet smell fills your nose as you pour the mixture over the egg, and the shell slowly changes to a lighter color."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseOviElixerOnEmber.PourGreenElixer": "Uncorking the crystalline bottle, you pour the strange green liquid inside onto the egg, briefly wondering what on earth it could want with this stuff, before catching your fallacy. It's an egg, right? It can't want things... The fluid spills all over the shell, coating it, and then seeps inside, leaving the egg's previously pale surface marked with small green splotches."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseSuccubiMilkOnEmber.PourSuccubiMilk": "Popping the cap off of the milk bottle, you pour the contents onto the egg - the porous shell soaks up the milk as fast as you dump it, spilling not a drop."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseSuccubiMilkOnEmber.ShellLavender": " The egg's shell slowly changes to a lavender hue."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.UseSuccubiMilkOnEmber.ShellMutedPink": " The egg's shell slowly changes to a muted pink color."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.AnywayTheDragon": ", anyway. The dragon "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BackBetweenSuffix": " on the back between "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BlowsOnLoveEgg": "then [Ember ey] blows softly on your contracting love-hole, slowly extending [Ember eir] tongue to penetrate you."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BlowsOnLoveHole": "then [Ember ey] blows softly on your contracting love-hole, slowly extending [Ember eir] tongue to penetrate you."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BlushesAndPrefix": "blushes and "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BlushesAndThenPrefix": "blushes and then "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BoundaryPleasureEgg": "on the boundary between pleasure and pain. You aren't sure how much more you can take."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BoundaryPleasurePain": "on the boundary between pleasure and pain. You aren't sure how much more you can take."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.BoyWord": "boy"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.CloseEyesPassOut": "[pg]You close your eyes, exhausted and happy to see your child. Before you realize it, you've passed out. When you awaken, you find yourself lying in your [bed], Ember hovering protectively over you. You ask where the baby is."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.CoosGigglesNuzzles": " coos, giggles and nuzzles into your neck, clearly happy to be here in the real world at last."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.DeliciouslyWord": "deliciously "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.DeliciouslyWordEgg": "deliciously "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.DoublingOverHowl": "You find yourself doubling over - well, as far as you can given your hugely gravid stomach, letting out a hollow cry of pain. You can feel the muscles in your midriff starting to squeeze and ripple in a fashion you just know signifies the onset of labor. You cry out for Ember to come and attend you. Ember rushes towards you in a blur, stopping mere inches from you, panting. [say: What is it? Is it time!? Are you in labor!?] [Ember ey] asks in a hurry. You nod and tell [Ember em] that you are."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.DoublingOverHowlEgg": "You find yourself doubling over - well, as far as you can given your hugely gravid stomach, letting out a hollow cry of pain. You can feel the muscles in your midriff starting to squeeze and ripple in a fashion you just know signifies the onset of labor. You cry out for Ember to come and attend you. Ember rushes towards you in a blur, stopping mere inches from you, panting. [say: What is it? Is it time!? Are you ready to lay!?] [Ember ey] asks in a hurry. You nod and tell [Ember em] that you are."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberDigsDeeper": "[pg]Ember complies, digging deeper into your searing hot canal. One of [Ember eir] clawed hands gently reaches out to touch the slithering bulge within your belly, massaging you as best as [Ember ey] can. Slowly but steadily, the baby dragon within you starts making its way down your birth canal, stretching you out as it seeks freedom."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberDigsDeeperEgg": "[pg]Ember complies, digging deeper into your searing hot canal; one of [Ember eir] clawed hands, gently reach out to the protruding bulge within your belly, massaging you as best as [Ember ey] can. Slowly but steadily, the draconic egg within you starts making its way down your birth canal, stretching you out as it seeks freedom."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberEggToDen": "[pg]Ember wastes no time - [Ember ey] hefts you into [Ember eir] arms and takes you to [Ember eir] den, gently setting you down on the soft leaves. Then [Ember ey] starts undressing you, stripping your [armor] as quickly as [Ember ey] can. [say: Okay, Okay... What do you need? W-what should I do!? Do you need anything!? How are you feeling!?] Ember asks in panic, the excitement of what's about to happen too much to bear for the dragon{0}."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberHeftsToDen": "[pg]Ember wastes no time, [Ember ey] hefts you into [Ember eir] arms and takes you to [Ember eir] den, gently setting you down on the soft leaves; then [Ember ey] starts undressing you, stripping your [armor] as quickly as [Ember ey] can. [say: Okay, Okay... What do you need? W-what should I do!? Do you need anything!? How are you feeling!?] Ember asks in panic, the excitement of what's about to happen too much to bear for the dragon{0}."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberOffersToTend": "[pg][say: I'll tend to the little one, you can just rest for a while longer,] Ember offers, taking the cute little dragon up in [Ember eir] arms. You sigh and nod your head gratefully, then lay back down to get some more rest.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberPointsToChest": "[pg]Ember calmly smiles at you and points to your [chest]. You follow [Ember eir] finger to see the little dragon nursing from your [nipple]. [saystart]Sorry. "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberSighsSmiles": "[pg]Ember sighs and smiles at you. [saystart]It's a beautiful, healthy, little "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.EmberWord": "[pg]Ember "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.ErrorMessage": "ERROR {0}"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.FaceCriesSoftly": " face and starts to cry softly. You gently help "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.FaintlyHearEmber": "[pg][say: ...you... alright?...] You faintly hear Ember asking you. You look into [Ember eir] eyes and manage to nod weakly. Ember's worried face turns to one of relief, [Ember ey] calmly tends to the wailing dragonling while waiting for you to rest for a little while, licking it over to clean it from the fluids that came with and on your baby."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.FaintlyHearEmberEgg": "[pg][say: ...you... all right?...] You faintly hear Ember asking you. You look into [Ember eir] eyes and manage to nod weakly. Ember's worried face turns to one of relief, [Ember ey] calmly tends to the egg while waiting for you to rest for a little while, licking it over to clean it from the fluids that came with and on the egg."
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.FeelingBetterSuffix": " feeling better. "
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.FetchCleanCloths": "[pg][say: Okay! Right!] Ember hurries off to fetch a bunch of clean cloths, then spreads them all over the leafy grass of [Ember eir] den. {0} carefully helps you onto them and spreads your legs, kneeling between them. [say: I'm going to try something... tell me how you're feeling.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.FetchCleanClothsEgg": "[pg][say: Okay! Right!] Ember hurries off to fetch a bunch of clean cloths; then spreads them all over the leafy grass of [Ember eir] den. Carefully, [Ember ey] helps you on them and spreads your [legs], kneeling between them. [say: I'm going to try something... Tell me how you're feeling.]"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.GirlWord": "girl"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.GritTeethSore": "[pg]You grit out between your teeth that you are feeling very sore, and what you want is for [Ember em] to help you somewhere comfortable so you can get this slithering snake of a baby out of your guts - preferably before he or she kicks his-her way out straight through your belly rather than coming down the birth canal!"
  "Scenes.Emberscene.VaginalBirth.GritTeethSoreEgg": "[pg]You grit out between your teeth that you are feeling very sore, and what you want is for [Ember em] to help you somewhere comfortable so you can get this huge damn egg out of you."
